# Bulk raw generations (potentially large, scientifically important but not
# meant for git history) go here - keep excluded. Small provenance/milestone
# logs under artifacts/logs/ are intentionally NOT excluded (see docs/PRIOR_WORK_MATRIX.md
# process note and §56 of the continuation directive: small representative
# samples are fine to version, bulk raw output is not).
