*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.gguf
.env
*.token

# Exact maintainer-workstation provenance (GPU UUIDs/PCI IDs, cache paths,
# auth-expiry detail) - scientifically useful facts derived from these live
# in public docs/ in abstracted form; the exact fingerprinting stays local.
# See docs/reproducibility.md and the "public vs maintainer-only
# provenance" note in docs/MODEL_AUDIT.md.
.local/


